msgstr ""
"然後，將 :guilabel:`ID`（應用程式 ID）及 :guilabel:`Secret（用戶端密碼值）` "
"複製並貼上至相應欄位，並:guilabel:`儲存`設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:155
