msgstr "用於在新建立的應用程式與 Odoo 之間授予存取權限的權限頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/email_communication/azure_oauth.rst:180
msgid ""
"Then, allow Odoo to access the Microsoft account by clicking on "
