#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/measurement_tool.rst:72
msgid "Link a measurement tool to a work center in the Manufacturing app"
msgstr "在製造應用程式中將測量工具連結至工作中心"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/measurement_tool.rst:74
msgid ""
"To link a measurement tool to an action, it first needs to be configured on "
"a work center. To do that, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app -->"
" Configuration --> Work Centers`. Then, select the desired work center in "
"which the measurement tool will be used."
msgstr ""
"如要將測量工具連結至動作，必須先在工作中心內進行設定。為此，請前往 "
":menuselection:`製造應用程式 --> 配置 --> 工作中心`。然後，選擇將使用該測量工"
"具的工作中心。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/measurement_tool.rst:78
msgid ""
"On the work center page, add the device in the :guilabel:`IoT Triggers` tab,"
" under the :guilabel:`Device` column, by selecting :guilabel:`Add a Line`. "
"Then, the measurement tool can be linked to the :guilabel:`Action` drop-down"
" menu option labeled :guilabel:`Take Measure`. A key can be added to trigger"
" the action."
msgstr ""
"在工作中心頁面中，於 :guilabel:`IoT 觸發條件` 分頁的 :guilabel:`裝置` 欄下，"
"選擇 :guilabel:`新增資料行` 以新增裝置。然後，可將測量工具連結至 "
":guilabel:`動作` 下拉式選單中名為 :guilabel:`進行測量` 的選項。亦可新增按鍵以"
"觸發此動作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/measurement_tool.rst:84
msgid ""
"It should be noted that the first listed trigger is chosen first. The order "
"matters, and these triggers can be dragged into any order."
msgstr ""
"請注意，系統會優先選擇清單中的第一個觸發條件。排列順序十分重要，你可以將這些"
"觸發條件拖曳至任何順序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/measurement_tool.rst:88
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Work Order` screen, a status graphic indicates whether the"
" database is correctly connected to the measurement tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:3
msgid "Connect a printer"
msgstr "連接打印機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:5
msgid ""
"Printer installation can be done in a few easy steps. The printer can be "
"used to print receipts, labels, orders, or even reports from the different "
"Odoo apps. In addition, printer actions can be assigned as an *action on a "
"trigger* during the manufacturing process, or added onto a quality control "
"point or a quality check."
msgstr ""
"只需幾個簡單步驟即可完成打印機安裝。安裝後，打印機可用於從不同的 Odoo 應用程"
"式列印收據、標籤、訂單，甚至報告。此外，亦可在製造過程中將打印機操作指派為*觸"
"發操作*，或將其加至品質控制點或品質檢查中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:11
msgid ""
"The **only** way to connect a printer directly to an Odoo database is "
"through the use of an IoT system. Without an IoT system, printing can still "
"occur, but it is managed through the printer itself, which is not the "
"recommended process."
msgstr ""
"將打印機直接連接至 Odoo 資料庫的 **唯一** 方法是使用 IoT 系統。如果沒有 IoT "
"系統，雖然仍可進行列印，但必須透過打印機本身管理，這並非建議的做法。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:18
msgid ""
"IoT systems support printers connected through USB or network connection. "
"`Supported printers <https://www.odoo.com/page/iot-hardware>`_ are detected "
"automatically, and appear in the :guilabel:`Devices` list of the IoT app."
msgstr ""
"IoT 系統支援透過 USB 或網絡連接的印表機。系統會自動偵測 `支援的印表機 "
"<https://www.odoo.com/page/iot-hardware>`_，並於 IoT 應用程式的 :guilabel:`裝"
"置` 清單中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:22
msgid "The printer as it would appear in the IoT app devices list."
msgstr "在 IoT 應用程式裝置清單中顯示的打印機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:26
msgid ""
"Printers connecting to the IoT system via the network must be on the **same "
"network** as the IoT system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:30
msgid ""
"Printers can take up to two minutes to appear in the IoT app's "
":guilabel:`Devices` list."
msgstr "打印機最多可能需要兩分鐘，才會在 IoT 應用程式的 :guilabel:`裝置` 清單中顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:33
msgid ""
"To test the printer, open the IoT app, click the :ref:`IoT system's card "
"<iot/connect/IoT-form>`, select the printer device, then click "
":guilabel:`Test`. A successful test prints a test page. If no page is "
"printed, ensure the printer is powered on and the connection is correct."
msgstr ""
"要測試打印機，請開啟 IoT 應用程式，按一下 :ref:`IoT 系統卡片 <iot/connect/"
"IoT-form>`，選擇打印機裝置，然後按一下 :guilabel:`測試`。測試成功後會列印測試"
"頁。如沒有列印出頁面，請確保打印機電源已開啟，且連線正確。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:38
msgid "Link a printer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:41
msgid "Link work orders to a printer"
msgstr "將工單連結至打印機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:43
msgid ""
"Work orders can be linked to printers, via a quality control point, to print"
" labels for manufactured products."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:46
msgid ""
"In the :doc:`Quality app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality>`, a "
"device can be set up on a quality control point. To do so, go to the "
":menuselection:`Quality --> Quality Control --> Control Points`, and open "
"the desired control point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:51
msgid ""
"A manufacturing operation and work order operation need to be attached to a "
"quality control point before the :guilabel:`Type` field allows for the "
":guilabel:`Print Label` option to be selected."
msgstr ""
"必須先將製造作業及工單作業附加至品質控制點，才可在 :guilabel:`類型` 欄位中選"
"取 :guilabel:`列印標籤` 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:55
msgid ""
"From here, edit the control point by selecting the :guilabel:`Type` field, "
"and selecting :guilabel:`Print Label` from the dropdown menu of options. "
"Doing so reveals the :guilabel:`Device` field, where the attached device can"
" be selected."
msgstr ""
"在此頁面，編輯控制點：選擇 :guilabel:`類型` 欄位，然後從選項下拉式選單中選擇 "
":guilabel:`列印標籤`。完成後會顯示 :guilabel:`裝置` 欄位，供您選擇已連接的裝"
"置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:59
msgid ""
"The printer can now be used with the selected quality control point. When "
"the quality control point is reached during the manufacturing process, the "
"database presents the option to print labels for a specific product."
msgstr ""
"列印機現已可配合所選的品質控制點使用。在製造過程中到達該品質控制點時，資料庫"
"會顯示為特定產品列印標籤的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:64
msgid ""
"Quality control points can also be accessed by navigating to "
":menuselection:`IoT --> Devices`, then selecting the device. Go to the "
":guilabel:`Quality Control Points` tab to add them to the device."
msgstr ""
"你亦可前往 :menuselection:`IoT --> 裝置`，然後選擇相關裝置，以存取品質控制點"
"。前往 :guilabel:`品質控制點` 分頁，即可將其新增至該裝置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:69
msgid ""
"On a :doc:`quality check form "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_management/quality_checks>`,"
" the :guilabel:`Type` of check can also be set to :guilabel:`Print Label`."
msgstr ""
"在 :doc:`品質檢查表單 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/"
"quality_management/quality_checks>` 上，檢查的 :guilabel:`類型` 亦可設為 "
":guilabel:`列印標籤`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:80
msgid "Link reports to a printer"
msgstr "將報表連結至打印機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:82
msgid "It is possible to link report types to a specific printer. To do so:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:84
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`IoT --> Devices` and select the desired printer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:85
msgid ""
"Go to the :guilabel:`Printer Reports` tab and click :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr "前往 :guilabel:`印表機報表` 分頁，然後點擊 :guilabel:`加入資料行`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:86
msgid ""
"In the pop-up that opens, select the types of reports to be linked to the "
"printer and click :guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr ""
"在開啟的彈出式視窗中，選擇要連結至該打印機的報表類型，然後點擊 :guilabel:`選"
"擇`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:89
msgid "The list of reports assigned to a printer in the IoT app."
msgstr "在 IoT 應用程式中指派給打印機的報表清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:93
msgid ""
"Reports can also be configured by :ref:`enabling the developer mode "
"<developer-mode>` and going to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> "
"Reports`. Select the desired report from the list and set an :guilabel:`IoT "
"Device`."
msgstr ""
"你亦可透過 :ref:`啟用開發人員模式 <developer-mode>` 並前往 :menuselection:`設"
"定 --> 技術 --> 報表` 來設定報表。從清單中選擇所需報表，然後設定 "
":guilabel:`IoT 裝置`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:97
msgid ""
"The first time a linked report is selected to print, a :guilabel:`Select "
"Printers` pop-up window appears. Tick the checkbox next to the correct "
"printer for the report, and click :guilabel:`Print`. At that point, the "
"report is linked to the printer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:102
msgid "Clear device printer cache"
msgstr "清除裝置打印機快取"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:104
msgid ""
"After a printer is linked to print a report, the setting is saved in a "
"browser's cache. This means a user can have different devices saved in their"
" cache for different reports, based on the device they use to access Odoo. "
"It also means different users can have a report automatically printed from "
"different printers, based on their preferences."
msgstr ""
"將打印機連結至列印報表後，該設定會儲存在瀏覽器的快取中。這表示用戶可根據用來"
"存取 Odoo 的裝置，在快取中為不同報表儲存不同的裝置。同時，不同用戶亦可根據各"
"自的偏好，由不同打印機自動列印報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:109
msgid ""
"To unlink a report from a printer, navigate to :menuselection:`IoT --> "
"Configuration --> Reset Linked Printers`. This generates a list of reports "
"that are linked to a printer on the current device. Click the "
":guilabel:`Unlink` button next to each report to remove the link."
msgstr ""
"要取消報表與打印機的連結，請前往 :menuselection:`IoT --> 配置 --> 重設已連結"
"的打印機`。系統會列出目前裝置上已連結至打印機的報表。點擊每個報表旁的 "
":guilabel:`取消連結` 按鈕，即可移除連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:114
msgid ""
"This step **only** prevents the report from automatically printing to the "
"listed printer from the current browser. The report is still :ref:`linked "
"<iot/link-printer>` on the device, under the :guilabel:`Printer Reports` "
"tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:118
msgid "A list of reports currently linked to a printer in the IoT app."
msgstr "目前在 IoT 應用程式中連結至打印機的報告清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:122
msgid ":ref:`POS Order Printing <pos/restaurant/orders-printing>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:125
msgid "Potential issues"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:128
msgid "The printer is not detected"
msgstr "未偵測到打印機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:130
msgid ""
"If a printer does not appear in the devices list, go to the :ref:`IoT box's "
"<iot/iot-box/homepage>` or :ref:`Windows virtual IoT's <iot/windows-"
"iot/homepage>` homepage, click :guilabel:`Show` in the :guilabel:`Devices` "
"section, and make sure the printer is listed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:134
msgid ""
"If the printer does not appear on the IoT system's homepage, click "
":guilabel:`Printer Server`, then :guilabel:`Administration`, and "
":guilabel:`Add Printer`. If the printer is not in the list, it is likely not"
" connected properly."
msgstr ""
"如果印表機未顯示於 IoT 系統的首頁，請點擊 :guilabel:`印表機伺服器`，再點擊 "
":guilabel:`管理`，然後選擇 :guilabel:`新增印表機`。如果列表中沒有該印表機，則"
"可能是未有正確連接。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:139
msgid "The printer outputs random text"
msgstr "打印機輸出隨機文字"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:141
msgid ""
"For most printers, the correct driver should be automatically detected and "
"selected. However, in some cases, the automatic detection mechanism might "
"not be enough, and if no driver is found, the printer might print random "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"對於大多數打印機，系統應能自動偵測並選取正確的驅動程式。然而，在某些情況下，"
"自動偵測機制可能不足夠；如果找不到驅動程式，打印機可能會列印出亂碼字元。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:145
msgid ""
"The solution is to manually select the corresponding driver. On the IoT "
"system's homepage, click :guilabel:`Printer Server`, then "
":guilabel:`Printers`, and select the printer in the list. In the "
":guilabel:`Administration` dropdown menu, click :guilabel:`Modify Printer`. "
"Follow the steps and select the printer's *make* and *model*."
msgstr ""
"解決方法是手動選擇相應的驅動程式。在 IoT 系統首頁上，點擊 :guilabel:`打印伺服"
"器`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`打印機`，並在清單中選擇該打印機。在 :guilabel:`管"
"理` 下拉式選單中，點擊 :guilabel:`修改打印機`。按照步驟操作，並選擇打印機的 "
"*品牌* 及 *型號*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:150
msgid "Edit the printer connected to the IoT system."
msgstr "編輯連接至 IoT 系統的打印機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:155
msgid ""
"Epson receipt printers and Zebra label printers do not need a driver to "
"work. Make sure that no driver is selected for those printers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:159
msgid "Epson configuration special case"
msgstr "Epson 設定特殊情況"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:161
msgid ""
"Most Epson printers support printing receipts in Odoo Point of Sale using "
"the `GS v 0` command. However, the following Epson printer models do not "
"support this command:"
msgstr ""
"大部分 Epson 打印機均支援在 Odoo 銷售點中使用 `GS v 0` 指令列印收據。不過，以"
"下 Epson 打印機型號不支援此指令："

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:164
msgid "TM-U220"
msgstr "TM-U220"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:165
msgid "TM-U230"
msgstr "TM-U230"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:166
msgid "TM-P60"
msgstr "TM-P60"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:167
msgid "TMP-P60II"
msgstr "TMP-P60II"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:169
msgid ""
"To bypass this issue, you can configure the printer to use the `ESC *` "
"command."
msgstr "要繞過此問題，您可以設定打印機使用 `ESC *` 指令。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:171
msgid ""
"First, review Epson's website for compatibility for both the `GS v 0 "
"<https://download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/pos/reference_en/escpos/gs_lv_0.html>`_"
" and `ESC * "
"<https://download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/pos/reference_en/escpos/esc_asterisk.html>`_"
" commands."
msgstr ""
"首先，請瀏覽 Epson 網站，查看 `GS v 0 <https://download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/"
"pos/reference_en/escpos/gs_lv_0.html>`_ 及 `ESC * <https://"
"download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/pos/reference_en/escpos/esc_asterisk.html>`_ 指"
"令的相容性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:175
msgid ""
"If the printer is incompatible with `GS v 0` but supports `ESC *`, configure"
" the IoT system to use the `ESC *` command as follows:"
msgstr ""
"如果印表機不相容 `GS v 0`，但支援 `ESC *`，請按以下步驟設定 IoT 系統以使用 "
"`ESC *` 指令："

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:178
msgid ""
"Access the :ref:`IoT box's <iot/iot-box/homepage>` or :ref:`Windows virtual "
"IoT's <iot/windows-iot/homepage>` homepage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:180
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Printer server` button, then click "
":guilabel:`Administration` on the CUPS page."
msgstr ""
"按一下:guilabel:`打印機伺服器`按鈕，然後在 CUPS 頁面上按一下:guilabel:`管"
"理`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:182
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add Printer` in the :guilabel:`Printers` section, select "
"the printer, and click :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`新增印表機`（位於 :guilabel:`印表機` 部分），選擇印表機，然"
"後按一下 :guilabel:`繼續`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:186
msgid "If the printer's name is still uncertain, take the following steps:"
msgstr "如果仍無法確定打印機名稱，請執行以下步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:188
msgid "Take note of the listed printers on the CUPS page."
msgstr "記下 CUPS 頁面上列出的打印機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:189
msgid "Turn the printer off and refresh the page."
msgstr "關閉打印機並重新整理頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:190
msgid ""
"Compare the difference with the first list to see which printer disappeared."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:191
msgid "Turn the printer back on and refresh the page again."
msgstr "重新開啟列印機電源，並再次重新整理頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:192
msgid "Double-check the list again to see if the printer re-appears."
msgstr "請再次檢查清單，看看打印機是否重新出現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:193
msgid ""
"The printer that disappeared and reappears again on the listed printers is "
"the name of the printer in question. It can be :guilabel:`Unknown` under "
":guilabel:`Local printers`."
msgstr ""
"在打印機清單中消失後再重新出現的項目，即為該打印機的名稱。該名稱可能會是 "
":guilabel:`未知`，位於 :guilabel:`本機打印機` 之下。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:196
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Add Printer` page, specify the printer's :guilabel:`Name` "
"using the following convention: "
"`<printer_name>__IMC_<param_1>_<param_2>_..._<param_n>__`, where:"
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`新增打印機` 頁面上，按以下命名規則指定打印機的 :guilabel:`名"
"稱`：`<printer_name>__IMC_<param_1>_<param_2>_..._<param_n>__`，其中："

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:199
msgid ""
"`printer_name` is the printer's name. It can contain any character except "
"`_`, `/`, `#`, or ` ` (space character)."
msgstr ""
"`printer_name` 是打印機名稱。它可以包含任何字元，但 `_`、`/`、`#` 或 ` `（空"
"格字元）除外。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:201
msgid ""
"`IMC`: This stands for *Image Mode Column* (the simplified name for `ESC "
"*`)."
msgstr "`IMC`：代表 *Image Mode Column* （影像模式欄，為 `ESC *` 的簡稱）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:202
msgid "`param_1`: This stands for the specific parameter:"
msgstr "`param_1`：這代表特定參數："

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:204
msgid ""
"`SCALE<X>`: Scale of the picture (with the same aspect ratio). `X` should be"
" an integer describing the scale percentage that should be used. For "
"example, `100` is the original size, `50` is half the size, and `200` is "
"twice the size."
msgstr ""
