"預設情況下，大多數條碼掃描器均設定為美式 QWERTY 格式。如果條碼掃描器使用不同"
"的配置，請前往:menuselection:`IoT --> 裝置`，並點擊條碼裝置的卡片。然後，"
"在:guilabel:`鍵盤配置`欄位中選取正確的語言。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:467
#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:497
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Keyboard Layout` is language-specific, with available options"
" varying based on the device and the language of the database (e.g., "
":guilabel:`English (UK)`, :guilabel:`English (US)`, etc.)."
