msgid ""
"If the issue persists, :ref:`update its image <iot/updating_iot/image-code>`"
" by flashing the IoT box's card or :ref:`uninstalling the Windows virtual "
"IoT program <iot/windows_iot/uninstall>` and :ref:`reinstalling the virtual "
