#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:57
msgid ""
"The IoT system's homepage can be accessed using its IP address but not the "
"`xxx.odoo-iot.com` URL"
msgstr "可使用 IoT 系統的 IP 位址存取其首頁，但無法使用 `xxx.odoo-iot.com` 網址存取"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:59
msgid ""
"Contact your system or network administrator to address the issue. Network-"
"related problems are beyond the scope of Odoo support services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:62
msgid ""
"If the router allows manual :abbr:`DNS (Domain Name System)` configuration, "
"update the settings to use `Google DNS "
"<https://developers.google.com/speed/public-dns>`_."
msgstr ""
"如果路由器允許手動設定 :abbr:`DNS（網域名稱系統）`，請更新設定以使用 `Google "
"DNS <https://developers.google.com/speed/public-dns>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:64
msgid ""
"If the router does not support this, you need to update the DNS settings "
"directly on each device that interacts with the IoT system to use `Google "
"DNS <https://developers.google.com/speed/public-dns>`_. Instructions for "
"configuring DNS on individual devices can be found on the respective "
"manufacturer's website."
msgstr ""
"如果路由器不支援此功能，您需要直接在每個與 IoT 系統互動的裝置上更新 DNS 設定"
"，以使用 `Google DNS <https://developers.google.com/speed/public-dns>`_。有關"
"在個別裝置上設定 DNS 的指示，請參閱相關製造商的網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:70
msgid ""
"Some IoT devices, such as payment terminals, likely do not require DNS "
"changes, as they are typically pre-configured with custom DNS settings."
msgstr ""
"部分 IoT 裝置（例如付款終端機）通常已預先配置自訂 DNS 設定，因此可能無需更改 "
"DNS。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:72
msgid ""
"On some browsers, an error code mentioning the DNS (such as "
"`DNS_PROBE_FINISHED_NXDOMAIN`) is displayed."
msgstr ""
"在部分瀏覽器上，系統會顯示提及 DNS 的錯誤代碼（例如 "
"`DNS_PROBE_FINISHED_NXDOMAIN`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:78
msgid ""
"The IoT system is connected and reports are assigned to a printer that "
"cannot print"
msgstr "IoT 系統已連線，且報表已指派給無法列印的印表機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:80
msgid ""
"Verify that the browser is allowed to :ref:`access devices on the local "
"network <pos/lna/browser-permission>`."
msgstr "請確認已允許瀏覽器 :ref:`存取本地網絡上的裝置 <pos/lna/browser-permission>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:85
msgid "HTTPS certificate generation issues and errors"
msgstr "HTTPS 證書產生問題及錯誤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:88
msgid "The HTTPS certificate does not generate"
msgstr "無法產生 HTTPS 憑證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:90
msgid "Potential causes include the following:"
msgstr "可能的原因包括以下各項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:92
msgid ""
"The database doesn't meet the :ref:`eligibility requirements "
"<iot/https_certificate_iot/iot-eligibility>` for generating an :ref:`HTTPS "
"certificate <iot/connect/https_certificate>`."
msgstr ""
"該資料庫未符合:ref:`資格要求 <iot/https_certificate_iot/iot-eligibility>`，無"
"法產生:ref:`HTTPS 憑證 <iot/connect/https_certificate>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:95
msgid ""
"The firewall is preventing the HTTPS certificate from generating correctly. "
"In this case, deactivate the firewall until the certificate is successfully "
"generated."
msgstr ""
"防火牆正阻止 HTTPS 憑證正確產生。在此情況下，請暫時停用防火牆，直至成功產生憑"
"證為止。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:99
msgid ""
"Some devices, such as routers with a built-in firewall, can prevent the "
"HTTPS certificate from generating."
msgstr "某些裝置（例如內置防火牆的路由器）可能會阻止系統產生 HTTPS 證書。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:103
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "錯誤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:105
msgid ""
"A specific error code is displayed on the IoT system's homepage if any "
"issues occur during the generation or reception of the :ref:`HTTPS "
"certificate <iot/connect/https_certificate>`."
msgstr ""
"如果在產生或接收:ref:`HTTPS 憑證 <iot/connect/https_certificate>`時發生任何問"
"題，IoT 系統首頁會顯示特定的錯誤代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:109
msgid ""
"When you access the IoT system's homepage, it automatically checks for an "
"HTTPS certificate and attempts to generate one if it is missing. If an error"
" appears, refresh the page to see if the issue is resolved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:114
msgid "Missing credentials"
msgstr "缺少憑證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:116
msgid ""
"The contract and/or database :abbr:`UUID (Universal Unique Identifier)` is "
"missing from the IoT."
msgstr "IoT 系統中缺少合約及／或資料庫的 :abbr:`UUID（通用唯一識別碼）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:118
msgid ""
"Verify that both values are correctly configured. To update them, "
":ref:`access the IoT box's <iot/iot-box/homepage>` or :ref:`Windows virtual "
"IoT's homepage <iot/windows-iot/homepage>`, click the :icon:`fa-cogs` "
"(:guilabel:`cogs`) button, then click :guilabel:`Credentials`."
msgstr ""
"確認兩個數值均已正確設定。如要更新，請 :ref:`前往 IoT 裝置盒 <iot/iot-box/"
"homepage>` 或 :ref:`Windows 虛擬 IoT 的主頁 <iot/windows-iot/homepage>`，點"
"擊 :icon:`fa-cogs`（:guilabel:`齒輪`）按鈕，然後點擊 :guilabel:`憑證`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:123
msgid ""
"To access the full request exception details with information regarding the "
"error, :ref:`enable the developer mode <developer-mode>`, click the IoT "
"system's card in the IoT app, and click :guilabel:`Download logs` on the "
":ref:`IoT system's form <iot/connect/IoT-form>`. To define the log levels "
"recorded in the IoT system's log file, :ref:`access the IoT box's "
"<iot/windows-iot/homepage>` or :ref:`Windows virtual IoT's <iot/iot-"
"box/homepage>` homepage, click the :icon:`fa-cogs` (:guilabel:`cogs`) "
"button, then :guilabel:`Log level` at the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"要查閱包含錯誤資訊的完整請求異常詳情，請:ref:`啟用開發者模式 <developer-mode>"
"`，在 IoT 應用程式中點擊 IoT 系統卡片，並點擊:guilabel:`下載日誌`（位"
"於:ref:`IoT 系統表單 <iot/connect/IoT-form>`）。要定義記錄在 IoT 系統日誌檔案"
"中的日誌級別，請:ref:`前往 IoT 盒子的 <iot/windows-iot/homepage>"
"`或:ref:`Windows 虛擬 IoT 的 <iot/iot-box/homepage>`主頁，點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"cogs`（:guilabel:`齒輪`）按鈕，然後在頁面底部點擊:guilabel:`日誌級別`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/iot_advanced/troubleshooting.rst:130
msgid ""
"To address network-related issues, contact your system or network "
