msgstr ":ref:`設定 Windows 防火牆 <iot/windows-iot/firewall>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Connect the Windows virtual IoT to your Odoo database <connect>`."
msgstr ":doc:`將 Windows 虛擬 IoT 連接至您的 Odoo 數據庫 <connect>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:15
msgid ""
