msgstr ":ref:`重新啟動 <iot/windows_iot/restart>` Windows 虛擬 IoT 服務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:53
msgid ""
"Check that you can access the :ref:`IoT system's homepage <iot/windows-"
