"security/operating-system-security/network-security/windows-firewall/rules>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:128
msgid "Windows virtual IoT homepage"
msgstr "Windows 虛擬 IoT 主頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:130
msgid ""
"To access the Windows virtual IoT's homepage, navigate to the URL "
"`http://localhost:8069` on the Windows virtual IoT computer or open a web "
"browser from another computer **on the same network as the IoT system** and "
"navigate to the URL `http://xxx:8069` (where `xxx` is the IoT system's IP "
"address)."
msgstr ""
"要存取 Windows 虛擬 IoT 的主頁，請在 Windows 虛擬 IoT 電腦上前往網址 `http://"
"localhost:8069`，或在**與 IoT 系統位於同一網絡**的另一部電腦開啟網頁瀏覽器，"
"並前往網址 `http://xxx:8069`（其中 `xxx` 為 IoT 系統的 IP 位址）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:135
msgid ""
"Once the Windows virtual IoT is :doc:`connected to the Odoo database "
"<connect>`, its homepage can be accessed from Odoo by opening the IoT app, "
"clicking the relevant IoT box's card, and clicking :guilabel:`Homepage`."
msgstr ""
"Windows 虛擬 IoT :doc:`連接至 Odoo 資料庫 <connect>` 後，你即可從 Odoo 存取其"
"主頁：開啟 IoT 應用程式，按一下相關 IoT Box 的卡片，然後按一下 :guilabel:`主"
"頁`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:139
msgid "Windows virtual IoT's homepage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:144
msgid ""
"Make sure the :ref:`Windows Firewall is configured <iot/windows-"
"iot/firewall>` to allow access."
msgstr "請確保:ref:`已設定 Windows 防火牆 <iot/windows-iot/firewall>`以允許存取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:149
msgid "Windows virtual IoT restart"
msgstr "重新啟動 Windows 虛擬 IoT"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:151
msgid ""
"To manually restart the Windows IoT server, search the Windows start menu "
"for `services` and select the Services app. Scroll down to the "
":guilabel:`odoo-server-xxx` service, right-click it, and select "
":guilabel:`Start` or :guilabel:`Restart`."
msgstr ""
"如要手動重新啟動 Windows IoT 伺服器，請在 Windows「開始」功能表搜尋 "
"`services`，並選擇「服務」應用程式。向下捲動至 :guilabel:`odoo-server-xxx` 服"
"務，按右鍵並選擇 :guilabel:`啟動` 或 :guilabel:`重新啟動`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:158
msgid "Windows virtual IoT uninstall"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/iot/windows_iot.rst:160
msgid ""
"To uninstall the Windows virtual IoT, `uninstall "
"<https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/uninstall-or-remove-apps-and-"
"programs-in-"
"windows-4b55f974-2cc6-2d2b-d092-5905080eaf98#ID0EBD=Windows_11>`_ the Odoo "
"program on your Windows computer. Confirm the uninstallation and complete "
"the steps in the :guilabel:`Odoo Uninstall` dialog."
msgstr ""
"要解除安裝 Windows 虛擬 IoT，請在 Windows 電腦上 `解除安裝 <https://"
"support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/uninstall-or-remove-apps-and-programs-in-"
"windows-4b55f974-2cc6-2d2b-d092-5905080eaf98#ID0EBD=Windows_11>`_ Odoo 程式。"
"確認解除安裝，並完成 :guilabel:`Odoo 解除安裝` 對話方塊中的步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:3
msgid "Offline mode"
msgstr "離線模式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:6
msgid ""
"Odoo’s offline mode provides a solution for short-term interruptions; it is "
"not intended to offer full or long-term offline capabilities."
msgstr "Odoo 的離線模式專為應對短期中斷而設，並不旨在提供完整或長期的離線功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:10
msgid ":ref:`Point of Sale offline mode <pos/use/offline-pos>`"
msgstr ":ref:`銷售點離線模式 <pos/use/offline-pos>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:12
msgid ""
"To ensure business continuity when connectivity is unreliable or "
"unavailable, such as while commuting or when working in locations with poor "
"or no coverage, Odoo makes certain functionality available offline for "
"logged-in users."
msgstr ""
"為確保業務連續性，即使在網絡連線不穩定或無法連線時（例如通勤期間，或在接收不"
"良或沒有訊號覆蓋的地點工作），已登入的使用者仍可離線使用 Odoo 的部分功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:16
msgid ""
"As soon as the internet connection is no longer active, a :guilabel:`Working"
" offline` button appears in the database header. Views or records that were "
"previously opened while online can be reopened, regardless of whether they "
"were active in the browser at the moment connectivity was lost. Records can "
"be :ref:`edited, deleted, archived, unarchived, or created <general/offline-"
"mode/records-create-udpate>`, provided certain conditions are met. "
"Previously performed :ref:`search queries <general/offline-mode/search>` can"
" be run again."
msgstr ""
"一旦互聯網連線中斷，資料庫頁首便會顯示 :guilabel:`離線工作` 按鈕。無論斷線當"
"時該檢視畫面或記錄是否在瀏覽器中處於開啟狀態，只要先前在線時曾經開啟過，均可"
"重新開啟。只要符合特定條件，即可 :ref:`編輯、刪除、封存、取消封存或建立 "
"<general/offline-mode/records-create-udpate>` 記錄，亦可再次執行先前進行過的 "
":ref:`搜尋查詢 <general/offline-mode/search>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:23
msgid "Items that are not available offline are grayed out."
msgstr "離線時無法使用的項目會顯示為灰色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:25
msgid "Elements not available offline are grayed out"
msgstr "無法離線使用的項目會顯示為灰色"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:28
msgid ""
"Any changes made offline are :ref:`queued locally <general/offline-"
"mode/manage-changes>`; when connectivity is restored, changes are synced "
"automatically and reflected in your database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:32
msgid ""
"If you foresee connectivity issues, briefly open any views or records you "
"expect to need, and perform any searches so they can still be accessed "
"if/when connectivity is lost."
msgstr ""
"如果您預計會出現連線問題，請預先簡短開啟您預期需要使用的任何檢視畫面或記錄，"
"並執行任何搜尋，以便在連線中斷時仍可存取相關內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:36
msgid ""
"Odoo supports offline access for apps and modules built using :doc:`standard"
" Odoo framework components "
"</developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview>`."
msgstr ""
"對於使用:doc:`標準 Odoo 框架元件 </developer/reference/frontend/"
"framework_overview>`建構的應用程式和模組，Odoo 支援離線存取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:38
msgid ""
"For performance reasons, Odoo allocates a maximum of 2 GB for offline data. "
"When this limit is reached, the oldest data is removed to make room for the "
"most recent activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:40
msgid ""
"Performing a hard refresh using `Ctrl + F5` or `Cmd + Shift + R`, e.g., for "
"troubleshooting reasons, removes all locally stored data. This impacts the "
"availability of views and records in offline mode."
msgstr ""
"使用 `Ctrl + F5` 或 `Cmd + Shift + R` 執行強制重新整理（例如用於排解疑難）會"
"移除所有儲存在本機的資料，這會影響離線模式下檢視畫面及記錄的可用性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:47
msgid "Create and update records"
msgstr "建立及更新記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:49
msgid "When offline, records can be:"
msgstr "離線時，記錄可以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:51
msgid ""
"created, provided a record of the same type was previously created while you"
" were online"
msgstr "建立，前提是您先前在連線狀態下曾建立過同類型的記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:52
msgid ""
"edited, deleted, archived, or unarchived, provided they were previously "
"opened while you were online"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:56
msgid ""
"Attachments and images can be opened while offline, but cannot be uploaded "
"or deleted."
msgstr "離線時可開啟附件及圖片，但無法上載或刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:61
msgid "Perform searches"
msgstr "執行搜尋"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:63
msgid ""
"Search queries that were previously performed while online can be repeated "
"offline. To repeat a previously performed search, click in the search bar, "
"then choose from the available searches."
msgstr ""
"之前在連線狀態下執行的搜尋查詢，可在離線時重複執行。要重複之前執行的搜尋，請"
"點擊搜尋欄，然後從可用的搜尋項目中選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:66
msgid "Previous executed searches available via search bar"
msgstr "可透過搜尋列存取先前執行的搜尋"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:73
msgid "Manage offline changes"
msgstr "管理離線變更"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:75
msgid ""
"When you create or update a record offline, the changes are stored locally "
"in a temporary queue until the internet connection is restored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:78
msgid ""
"To view pending changes while still offline, click the :guilabel:`Working "
"offline` button; modified records are listed, with a tag showing whether the"
" record was :guilabel:`Created`, :guilabel:`Edited`, :guilabel:`Archived`, "
"or :guilabel:`Unarchived`."
msgstr ""
"如要在離線狀態下查看待處理的變更，請按一下 :guilabel:`離線運作` 按鈕；系統會"
"列出已修改的記錄，並以標籤顯示記錄狀態為 :guilabel:`已建立`、:guilabel:`已編"
"輯`、:guilabel:`已封存` 或 :guilabel:`已取消封存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:82
msgid "Hovering over an :guilabel:`Edited` tag reveals the changes made."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:85
msgid ""
"In the example, the :guilabel:`Office Design and Architecture` opportunity "
"was edited to change the :guilabel:`Salesperson` (technical field name "
":guilabel:`user_id`) from `Mitchell Admin` to `Marc Demo` and the "
":guilabel:`Expected Revenue` from `9000` to `15000`."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，我們編輯了 :guilabel:`辦公室設計及建築` 商機，將 :guilabel:`銷售"
"員`（技術欄位名稱為 :guilabel:`user_id`）從 `Mitchell Admin` 變更為 `Marc "
"Demo`，並將 :guilabel:`預期收益` 從 `9000` 變更為 `15000`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:89
msgid ""
"Dropdown on Working offline button showing list of changes made offline"
msgstr "「離線工作」按鈕上的下拉式選單，顯示離線時所作的更改清單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:93
msgid ""
"To make further changes to an edited record while still offline, click the "
"record to open it locally. To discard pending changes while still offline, "
"for example, if changes were made in error or in the wrong order, click the "
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(Discard offline changes)` icon."
msgstr ""
"如要在仍處於離線狀態時對已編輯的記錄作進一步更改，請點擊該記錄以在本地開啟。"
"如要在仍處於離線狀態時捨棄待處理的更改（例如更改出錯或順序錯誤），請點擊 "
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`（捨棄離線更改）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:100
msgid "Disable offline mode for specific views"
msgstr "為特定視圖停用離線模式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:102
msgid ""
"In some cases, for example, for reporting views, displaying outdated or "
"cached information may not be appropriate. To disable data caching for a "
"specific view and, as a result, make the view unavailable offline, follow "
"these steps:"
msgstr ""
"在某些情況下（例如報表檢視），顯示過時或快取資料可能並不合適。如要停用特定檢"
"視的資料快取，使該檢視無法離線使用，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:106
msgid "Open the view in question."
msgstr "開啟相關檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:107
msgid "Activate :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`."
msgstr "啟動 :ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:108
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-bug` :guilabel:`(bug)` icon in the database header, then"
" select :guilabel:`Action`."
msgstr ""
"按一下資料庫頂部標題列中的 :icon:`fa-bug` :guilabel:`(除錯)` 圖示，然後選擇 "
":guilabel:`動作`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/offline_mode.rst:110
msgid "Disable :guilabel:`Data caching`."
msgstr "停用 :guilabel:`資料快取`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo defines a *user* as someone who has access to a database. An "
"administrator can add as many users as the company needs and, in order to "
"restrict the type of information each user can access, rules can be applied "
"to each user. Users and access rights can be added and changed at any point."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 將*用戶*定義為有權存取資料庫的人員。管理員可按公司需要新增任意數量的用戶"
"；為限制每位用戶可存取的資料類型，可為各用戶套用規則。用戶及存取權限可隨時新"
"增及更改。"

