#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/2fa.rst:123
msgid ""
"Administrators can configure these policies using the *Timeouts* settings "
"available on user groups when the *auth_timeout* module is installed. See "
":ref:`Session and inactivity timeouts "
"<general/users/access_rights/timeouts>` for more information."
